@startuml UC-09-Melihat-Leaderboard
title Sequence Diagram: Melihat Leaderboard (Ranked)

actor "Users\n(Learner/Creator)" as User
participant "Halaman Leaderboard\ndengan Tab Kategori\n(React)" as UI
participant "GET /api/leaderboard" as API
participant "LeaderboardController" as Controller
participant "LeaderboardService" as Service
database "PostgreSQL\n(tabel Pengguna,\ntabel RiwayatBelajar)" as DB

User -> UI: Klik menu "Leaderboard"
activate UI
UI -> API: GET /api/leaderboard\n?category=total&period=all
activate API
API -> Controller: getLeaderboard(params)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: getRankings(category, period)
activate Service
Service -> DB: SELECT idAkun, namaLengkap,\ntotalXP, xpLearner, xpCreator,\nrankPeringkat FROM Pengguna\nWHERE totalXP > 0\nORDER BY totalXP DESC\nLIMIT 100
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return array data pengguna\ndengan XP tertinggi
deactivate DB

alt Ada data ranking
    Service -> Service: Tambahkan nomor\nperingkat (rank)
    Service -> Service: Cari posisi pengguna\nyang sedang login
    Service --> Controller: { success: true,\ndata: [...rankings],\nuserPosition: X,\nuserRank: 'Bronze' }
    Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
    API --> UI: Data leaderboard
    UI --> User: Menampilkan leaderboard\ndengan tab (Total XP,\nLearner, Creator)
    UI --> User: Tampilkan setiap entry:\nperingkat, nama, XP, rank badge
    UI -> UI: Highlight baris user\nyang sedang login
    User -> User: Melihat peringkat\ndiri sendiri dan lainnya
else Belum ada data ranking
    Service --> Controller: { success: true,\ndata: [], message:\n"Belum ada data" }
    Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
    API --> UI: Data kosong
    UI --> User: Tampilkan pesan\n"Belum ada data leaderboard"
end

deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
deactivate UI

== Alternate: Switch Kategori ==

User -> UI: Klik tab "Learner Terbaik"
activate UI
UI -> API: GET /api/leaderboard\n?category=learner&period=all
activate API
API -> Controller: getLeaderboard()
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: getRankings('learner', 'all')
activate Service
Service -> DB: SELECT idAkun, namaLengkap,\nxpLearner, rankPeringkat\nFROM Pengguna\nWHERE xpLearner > 0\nORDER BY xpLearner DESC\nLIMIT 100
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return data sorted by xpLearner
deactivate DB
Service --> Controller: Return rankings
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Data learner terbaik
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> User: Tampilkan leaderboard\nLearner
deactivate UI

== Alternate: Filter Periode Waktu ==

User -> UI: Pilih filter "Minggu Ini"
activate UI
UI -> API: GET /api/leaderboard\n?category=total&period=week
activate API
API -> Controller: getLeaderboard()
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: getRankings('total', 'week')
activate Service
Service -> DB: SELECT P.idAkun, P.namaLengkap,\nSUM(R.xpDidapat) as totalXPPeriod\nFROM Pengguna P\nJOIN RiwayatBelajar R\nON P.idAkun = R.idPengguna\nWHERE R.tanggalSelesai >=\nDATE_TRUNC('week', NOW())\nGROUP BY P.idAkun\nORDER BY totalXPPeriod DESC\nLIMIT 100
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return data XP\nuntuk periode minggu ini
deactivate DB
Service --> Controller: Return rankings
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Data periode minggu ini
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> User: Tampilkan leaderboard\nminggu ini
deactivate UI

== Alternate: Load More Pagination ==

User -> UI: Scroll sampai akhir,\nklik "Lihat Lebih Banyak"
activate UI
UI -> API: GET /api/leaderboard\n?offset=100&limit=100
activate API
API -> Controller: getLeaderboard(offset)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: getRankings() dengan offset
activate Service
Service -> DB: SELECT ... ORDER BY totalXP DESC\nLIMIT 100 OFFSET 100
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return 100 entry berikutnya\n(rank 101-200)
deactivate DB
Service --> Controller: Return data rank 101-200
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Data tambahan
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI -> UI: Append data baru\nke list yang ada
UI --> User: Tampilkan ranking 101-200
deactivate UI

== Exception: User Tidak Masuk Top List ==

note over Service, DB
  Jika user tidak di top 100:
  - Query posisi aktual user
  - Tampilkan info di bawah:
    "Anda di peringkat X.
     Kumpulkan XP untuk
     masuk top 100!"
end note

@enduml
